# Histogram Auto Exposure and Local Exposure on D3D11 (0) or the render graph (1): Whiterun at 13:00 in clear weather,
# then Dragonsreach, a shot of each. Compare the two runs' shots.
# Sub-effects on: "Histogram Auto Exposure", "Local Exposure" (Composite turns itself on for them; it must be ported for
# the chain to run on the graph). Off: "Depth of Field", "COD Bloom", "Lens Flare", "Motion Blur", "Physical Glare",
# "Camera" unless their ports are merged. Vignette, Color Grading and Tone Mapping, LUT and Border may stay on.
# Effects11 must not own the tonemap. On the graph the log names "chain built (input, local-exposure, auto-exposure,
# composite, ...)" and "the chain runs on the render graph".
CS_ORG_POST_PROCESSING=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;2000:fw 81a;2400:dclf:shot=whiterun;2500:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;3600:dclf:shot=dragonsreach
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3700
CS_ORG_REUSE_RECORDINGS=0
